// Sum of the least and the greatest winning labeled hammings.
// When they are the same value, that value is added twice.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE hesum ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG hesum rank

IMPULSE hesum 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "hesum" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
